expert's actions

10
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:44,420
and replicating their behavior. Unlike
reinforcement learning, which derives

11
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:47,060
a policy for a system's actions based on
its

12
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:51,740
