imitation learning aspires to

13
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:54,740
learn a policy through the observation of
another agent

14
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:58,740
interacting with the environment.
Imitation learning is the general

15
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,619
term for the class of algorithms that
learn through

16
